      491   END.
      492   ON CHOOSE OF b-sel-all-attr IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
      493   DO:
      494      run select-all-attr in this-procedure .
      495      RUN enable_UI.
      496      RUN post-enable_UI IN THIS-PROCEDURE .
